{"hymn":"S51","parent":"E65","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"Tu nombre amo yo","subtitle":"Alabanza al Señor—Su nombre","syl":{"n1":"Tu","n2":["nom","i"],"n3":["bre","t"],"n4":["a","i"],"n5":["mo","t"],"n6":"yo,","n7":["Se","i"],"n8":["ñor","t"],"n9":["Je","i"],"n10":["sús;","t"],"n11":"No","n12":["hay‿o","i"],"n13":["tro","t"],"n14":["co","i"],"n15":["mo","t"],"n16":"Tú,","n17":["Se","i"],"n19":["ñor","t"],"n20":["Je","i"],"n21":["sús.","t"],"n22":"Mi","n23":["to","i"],"n24":["do","t"],"n25":["de","i"],"n26":["bes","t"],"n27":"ser;","n28":"Sin","n29":"Ti","n30":"no","n31":["ten","i"],"n32":["go","t"],"n33":"bien;","n34":["Des","i"],"n35":["can","m"],"n36":["sa‿en","t"],"n37":"Ti","n38":"mi","n39":"fe,","n40":["Se","i"],"n42":["ñor","t"],"n43":["Je","i"],"n44":["sús.","t"]},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Como‿Hijo de‿Hombre, Tú,","Señor Jesús;","Moriste en la cruz,","Señor Jesús.","Más grande fue Tu‿amor","Que todo Tu dolor;","Es sin comparación,","Señor Jesús."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["En Ti ya justo soy,","Señor Jesús;","Tú mi refugio hoy,","Señor Jesús.","¿A quién he de temer?","¿Al duelo o padecer?","En Ti yo confiaré,","Señor Jesús."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Muy pronto Tú vendrás,","Señor Jesús;","Felices nos harás,","Señor Jesús.","Cuando contigo esté,","Tu rostro yo veré,","Y te reflejaré,","Señor Jesús."]}]}